Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.37,0:01:42.25,Default,Customer,0,0,0,TLC,Is this authentic?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.25,0:01:42.87,Default,Merchant,0,0,0,,Desigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.25,0:01:47.42,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Ai devenit și mai frumoasă?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.04,0:02:26.13,Default,Pairin,0,0,0,,Ce e această grămadă \Nuriașă, bunico?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.13,0:02:28.00,Default,Joka,0,0,0,,Se pare că a fost \Ncomandată de Maomao.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.00,0:02:28.92,Default,Pairin,0,0,0,,Din nou?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.72,Default,Old Lady,0,0,0,TLC,This'll be a good business.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.72,0:02:34.97,Default,Old Lady,0,0,0,TLC,Just deliver it like you're told.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.97,0:02:35.93,Default,Ukyou,0,0,0,,Am înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.39,0:02:46.77,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,TLC,They're beautiful.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.27,0:02:49.32,Default,Lihua,0,0,0,TLC,I'm thinking of keeping some in my room.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.73,0:02:52.19,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,E totul în regulă?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:52.19,0:02:53.82,Default,Lishu,0,0,0,,D-Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.31,0:03:27.65,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,După petrecerea din grădină, stăpânul Shishou \Na cerut mai multe slujitoare pentru ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.65,0:03:30.02,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,Dar asta e deja exagerat...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.02,0:03:34.32,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Da. Nu arată prea bine \Npentru celelalte concubine.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.03,0:03:38.20,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Bună, concubină Loulan.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.16,0:03:49.13,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Oh? Cauți ceva anume?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.54,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Oh, nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.29,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Maomao e la clinică.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.01,0:04:03.51,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Chiar a venit primăvara.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.86,0:04:17.40,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Ce meșterești?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.70,0:04:19.53,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,De ce mă întrebi de \Nparcă aș face ceva greșit?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.99,0:04:21.99,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Fac uleiuri parfumate.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.99,0:04:25.91,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,În timp ce curățam clinica, \Nam găsit un distilator.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.91,0:04:30.04,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Și folosesc câteva din florile rămase de la trandafirii \Nalbaștri pe care am reușit să-i cultivăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.33,0:04:31.92,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Mirosul e foarte puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.63,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Și tot nu e la fel de puternic \Nca al trandafirilor sălbatici.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:35.13,0:04:36.38,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Cu ce te pot ajuta?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.17,0:04:41.43,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Oricine și-ar face griji dacă ar \Nsimți un miros atât de puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.51,0:04:46.27,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Lucrezi aici deoarece nu ai tot \Nce-ți trebuie la Pavilionul de Jad?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.27,0:04:47.73,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Și asta, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.27,0:04:51.94,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Unele uleiuri parfumate \Npot provoca avorturi.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:51.94,0:04:55.36,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Nu ar trebui să fie o problemă decât \Ndacă sunt foarte concentrate, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.36,0:04:59.90,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Deci nu e nevoie să interzicem parfumurile și \Nalte lucruri de genul în palatul interior, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.70,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Da. Nu ar trebui să fie o problemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.16,0:05:05.12,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Doctorul gogoman e de treabă, \Ndar nu știe să-și țină gura.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.12,0:05:08.54,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu ar trebui să afle încă despre \Nsarcina concubinei Gyokuyou.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.54,0:05:09.41,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Ce e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.96,0:05:13.21,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Alcool distilat.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.21,0:05:16.67,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Prin distilări repetate, \Npot crea un alcool foarte puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.01,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Și plănuiești să-l bei?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.01,0:05:21.76,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,E pentru dezinfectat.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.76,0:05:23.76,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Vreau ca Pavilionul de Jad \Nsă fie cât mai curat posibil,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.76,0:05:26.35,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,deoarece avem o prințesă micuță.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.31,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Poți face așa ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.31,0:05:34.19,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Înmoi cârpa în asta și \Nștergi suprafețele și alte lucruri.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.48,0:05:36.02,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Știi foarte multe lucruri.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.02,0:05:38.19,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Am auzit că această metodă \Nse folosește în vest.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.19,0:05:41.45,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Oh, așa este. Tatăl tău adoptiv este...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.74,0:05:43.70,Default,Eunuch,0,0,0,,Am adus un pachet.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:50.00,0:05:51.50,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:51.50,0:05:53.71,Default,Guen,0,0,0,TLC,Ah, the little lady—
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.21,0:05:59.05,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Stăpâne Jinshi, voi pregăti niște ceai. \NVă rog să luați un loc.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.05,0:06:00.30,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Ce e în el?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.88,0:06:04.26,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Acest pachet este de la familia mea. \NNu e nimic important!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.76,0:06:07.10,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Oh, de la familia ta?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.10,0:06:08.39,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Care-i problema acestui tip?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.39,0:06:12.39,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,E-Este... lenjerie intimă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.52,0:06:15.44,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Oh... Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:16.31,0:06:21.99,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,Dar din ce e făcută lenjeria intimă dacă \Ne nevoie de doi oameni să care pachetul?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.20,0:06:28.16,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Problema palatului interior este că
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.16,0:06:31.66,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,se așteaptă ca femeile să fie foarte \Ninocente în privința actul sexual.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.95,0:06:35.67,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Majoritatea slujitoarelor \Naduse sunt virgine.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.34,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Dacă împăratul găsește o fată pe placul lui,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.34,0:06:41.67,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,iar ea nu se descurcă \Ndin cauza ignoranței?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.09,0:06:44.97,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Așa că m-am gândit că ar \Ntrebui instruite dinainte.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.97,0:06:47.80,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Și... de asta ai adus astea aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.55,0:06:51.85,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,Books, like the ones from\N back then. You know, {\i1}then{\i0}.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.60,0:06:56.40,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,{\i1}After all the work I did to get them \Ndelivered to the clinic,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.40,0:06:58.11,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,{\i1}out of Lady Hongniang's sight...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.69,0:07:01.61,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,{\i1}I used to order them for the emperor, \Nwho loves these,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.61,0:07:05.57,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,{\i1}but I increased the order to get more business.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.57,0:07:07.32,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,{\i1}Bad timing, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.33,0:07:11.62,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,Aceste cărți...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.99,0:07:14.54,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,sunt foarte bine făcute.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.54,0:07:16.50,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,Hârtia este de calitate.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.50,0:07:20.54,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Asta a observat? Credeam \Ncă e un pervers în secret.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.54,0:07:23.71,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,These books are sometimes used \Nas part of a new bride's package,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.71,0:07:27.64,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,and it's popular because the pictures are \Nenough to enjoy, even if you can't read.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.64,0:07:28.76,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,TLC,A print.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.76,0:07:32.60,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,Not woodblock prints, \Nbut ones that use metal plates.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.60,0:07:33.93,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Impresionant.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.93,0:07:38.65,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,Yes. Because it's so good, I wanted \Nas many people to see it as possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.15,0:07:41.57,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,TLC,That's a separate issue.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.95,0:07:48.91,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,TLC,If you find this to your liking, \Nperhaps you should keep one?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.53,0:07:52.03,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,TLC,N-No! That's definitely not it!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.91,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,TLC,I guess I can let you \Noff the hook this one time.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.91,0:07:58.42,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Serios?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.75,0:08:01.25,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Spune-mi ce magazin le vinde.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:03.63,0:08:06.80,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Nu e ce crezi! Vreau doar \Nsă aflu cum le tipăresc!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.43,0:08:12.30,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Da, sigur. Vrei să \Nștii magazinul, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:15.27,0:08:16.56,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,Xiaomao.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.56,0:08:17.35,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Da?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.19,0:08:21.61,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,Cred că va fi nevoie să \Ncenzurăm cărțile mai explicite.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.06,0:08:26.03,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,But the emperor said the previous ones \Nweren't exciting enough, so—
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.03,0:08:27.24,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.57,0:08:34.33,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mare păcat... Mai ales după ce i-am cerut \Nbunicii să le aleagă pe cele mai bune...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.84,0:08:49.34,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,TLC,Vai, ce sper să găsesc \Nsub florile albastre?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.10,0:08:56.14,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,TLC,Hei, ce crezi că e îngropat acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.93,0:08:57.93,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.39,0:08:59.31,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Bălegar?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.27,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Mănânci prea repede.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.27,0:09:03.77,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Nu, e vina ta!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.77,0:09:06.36,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Hei, acest roman e foarte popular!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.36,0:09:08.57,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Știi să citești, Xiaolan?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.57,0:09:13.20,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Nu! Dar una dintre fetele care \Nștiu ni-l citește cu voce tare.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.20,0:09:15.70,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Vreau să aflu cum se continuă!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.41,0:09:20.62,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}If even the illiterate \Nservant girls know the story,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.54,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}the book must truly be popular.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.63,0:09:29.09,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,M-am întors.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.63,0:09:30.84,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.84,0:09:34.26,Default,Guiyuan,0,0,0,,Împăratul l-a dat fiecărei concubine.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.26,0:09:37.77,Default,Guiyuan,0,0,0,,A spus că ar trebui să-l arate și \Ncelorlalți după ce termină de citit.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:37.77,0:09:39.43,Default,Yinghua,0,0,0,,Vrei și tu să-l citești, Maomao?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.48,0:09:45.86,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se pare că e același despre care \Nvorbea și Xiaolan. Un roman popular.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.86,0:09:51.61,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}These are considered low class \Nin high society. So I wonder why...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.61,0:09:54.11,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmm? This stamp...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.11,0:09:56.74,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's from the place I told \NMaster Jinshi about the other day.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.12,0:10:01.16,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}It might be a novel, but it's of a high \Nquality, befitting a gift from the emperor.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.16,0:10:05.92,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he gave it out to all of the concubines, \Nthere must be at least one hundred copies.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.92,0:10:09.00,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Master Jinshi must have \Nasked the emperor to do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.00,0:10:13.01,Default,Women,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wow! What a page-turner! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.46,0:10:12.17,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should have charged a commission!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.01,0:10:16.72,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}But why? Novels are considered lowly.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.72,0:10:20.14,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why hand it out to concubines of noble birth...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:23.73,0:10:29.44,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it had to do with politics. \NHe really was scheming something.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:29.44,0:10:31.53,Default,Yinghua,0,0,0,,Oh no, I finished it!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.90,0:10:34.11,Default,Yinghua,0,0,0,,Vreau să aflu cum se continue!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:34.11,0:10:38.83,Default,Guiyuan,0,0,0,,Gaoshun a spus că ni-l va da \Npe următorul când va fi gata.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.83,0:10:40.20,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,S-a întâmplat ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.79,0:10:45.08,Default,Ailan,0,0,0,,Ei bine, noi suntem singurele \Nslujitoare de la Pavilionul de Jad, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.08,0:10:51.17,Default,Ailan,0,0,0,,It feels like a waste, having a gift from \NLady Gyokuyou like this enjoyed by just us.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:51.17,0:10:55.59,Default,Yinghua,0,0,0,,But we can't hand it out to the girls \Noutside the pavilion. It's too precious.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.59,0:10:57.51,Default,Guiyuan,0,0,0,,Dacă l-ar pierde?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:57.97,0:10:59.72,Default,Ailan,0,0,0,,Ai dreptate.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.77,0:11:06.65,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Instead of handing out the originals, \Nyou could create copies yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.60,0:11:12.48,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Maybe the pictures are too difficult, \Nbut Lady Ailan, your penmanship is excellent.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:12.90,0:11:15.45,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be a problem\N for you to make copies.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.45,0:11:17.36,Default,Ailan,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.36,0:11:20.12,Default,Yinghua,0,0,0,,Yikes, that sounds like a lot of work!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.12,0:11:22.79,Default,Ailan,0,0,0,,Nu spune asta, Yinghua!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.79,0:11:27.25,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is probably the correct \Ninterpretation of Master Jinshi's idea.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.25,0:11:24.71,Default,Ailan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Haide să încercăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.37,Default,Guiyuan,0,0,0,,{\an8}De unde ar trebui să începem?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.75,0:11:30.00,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}If books became popular in the rear palace,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.29,0:11:33.13,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}mulți vor dori să învețe să citească,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.13,0:11:36.38,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}mai ales dacă e vorba \Nde un roman popular.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:37.26,0:11:42.10,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Back when I was Master Jinshi's \Nservant, he did ask me...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:42.51,0:11:46.60,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Apothecary, what do you think we can do to \Nimprove the literacy rate of the court ladies?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.48,0:11:51.19,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, he chose a very \Nroundabout way of doing it.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.61,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Hei, Maomao!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.61,0:11:57.91,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Învață-mă, te rog, \Nsă scriu și să citesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:57.91,0:11:58.99,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.49,0:12:04.79,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Fata care ne citea romane \Na răgușit de la prea mult vorbit.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.79,0:12:09.71,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,În schimb, ne-a făcut copii la cărți, \Ndar eu nu știu să citesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.00,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Atunci, ți l-aș putea citi eu—
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.21,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.96,0:12:18.97,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,That girl spent so much time making \Ncopies for me. I can't cheat like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:21.85,0:12:23.10,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good girl.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.14,0:12:24.89,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, what's this, all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.85,0:12:29.52,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Acesta e numele tău. \NÎncearcă să-l scrii și tu.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.52,0:12:30.40,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.27,0:12:36.99,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Nu știam că numele meu \Nera așa de complicat.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.99,0:12:40.99,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Writing helps you learn to read too, \Nbut do you want to just focus on reading?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:40.99,0:12:44.16,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Nu, aș vrea să învăț și să scriu!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.49,0:12:48.12,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Once I leave the rear palace, \NI have to work on my own.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.12,0:12:50.17,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Being able to read and write helps, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.13,0:12:54.54,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ce e asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.63,0:12:57.21,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Xiaolan se gândește la viitorul ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:57.76,0:13:00.13,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Let's go a bit quickly, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.13,0:13:01.68,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Da, doamnă!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.34,0:13:03.89,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Ce ai scris acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.31,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Mushroom fungus.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.31,0:13:06.22,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,And this?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:06.64,0:13:07.89,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Ciumăfaie.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.52,0:13:09.60,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.77,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Rădăcini de Kudzu.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.56,0:13:15.94,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Hey, are those commonly used words?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.03,0:13:18.82,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,We should start with greetings.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.82,0:13:19.99,Default,Xiaolan,0,0,0,,Sună bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:48.10,0:13:51.10,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Prințesa Lingli are voie \Nsă iasă la plimbare acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.10,0:13:56.52,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Da. Pavilionul a devenit puțin cam mic \Npentru ea, așa că am cerut permisiunea.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:57.15,0:13:59.86,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Chiar îi place să alerge peste tot.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:59.86,0:14:01.19,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Tu ce părere ai, Maomao?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.82,0:14:07.66,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,I agree. For the princess's health, it would\N be best for her to go outside more.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.24,0:14:11.41,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Two eunuchs will follow her as guards.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.41,0:14:14.50,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Could you and Hongniang accompany her?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.79,0:14:16.00,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Desigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.42,0:14:20.26,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}All of the emperor's previous children \Nhave passed away very young.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.26,0:14:22.88,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}This seems like a bit of \Nan overreaction for a simple walk,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.59,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I guess it's understandable.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.14,0:14:28.01,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Maomao, you know a lot about \Nflowers and creatures.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.47,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Can you teach Lingli while we're outside?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.35,0:14:35.81,Default,Hongniang,0,0,0,,Lady Gyokuyou, no! She'll teach \Nthe princess all sorts of nasty things.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.23,0:14:39.73,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Oh? I think it's useful.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.73,0:14:42.69,Default,Gyokuyou,0,0,0,,Cine știe unde se va mărita?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.69,0:14:48.08,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}The princess is still a baby, but in \Na decade or so, talks of marriage may arise.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.87,0:14:53.58,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she went to a foreign nation, \Nshe might not necessarily be welcome.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.58,0:14:59.84,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Knowing about medicines \Nand poisons can only help her.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.84,0:15:01.59,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chiar e o concubină inteligentă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.68,0:15:11.43,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Reactions to seeing the princess are varied.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.06,0:15:16.31,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}They represent the differing \Nviews towards her.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.98,0:15:20.82,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps soon, she'll learn \Nwhat those eyes mean.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.82,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,Aceea e o primulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.24,0:15:34.20,Default,Hongniang,0,0,0,,Oh, Princess!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.42,0:15:37.75,Default,Hongniang,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.84,0:15:41.75,Default,Hongniang,0,0,0,,Princess! You mustn't!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.75,0:15:42.71,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,I'll go take a look.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.59,0:15:49.89,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,O pisicuță?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.06,0:15:59.48,Default,Hongniang,0,0,0,,Prințesă!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.11,0:16:04.94,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,TLC,Trebuie s-o prind?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.32,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of, fie.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.95,0:16:15.91,Default,Shisui,0,0,0,,Te-am găsit!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.84,0:16:23.21,Default,Shisui,0,0,0,,Vrei pisicuța?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.51,0:16:34.39,Default,Shisui,0,0,0,,Oh, credeam că încerci s-o prinzi. \NM-am înșelat cumva?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:35.35,0:16:37.02,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.02,0:16:37.77,Default,Shisui,0,0,0,TLC,Poftim.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.69,0:16:42.40,Default,Shisui,0,0,0,,S-ar putea să-i fie foame. \NO voi lăsa în grija ta!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.11,0:16:43.98,Default,Shisui,0,0,0,,Ne mai vedem!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.82,Default,Hongniang,0,0,0,,Maomao, aia este...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.82,0:16:52.66,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Da, o pisică.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.12,0:16:58.50,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,E murdară. Micuța prințesă nu \Nar trebui s-o atingă deocamdată.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.62,0:17:01.25,Default,Hongniang,0,0,0,,D-Da...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:05.00,0:17:09.59,Default,Hongniang,0,0,0,,Let's keep it safe for the time being. \NI'll let management know.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.59,0:17:10.13,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.51,0:17:13.30,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,Oh, how rare. A kitten.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.60,0:17:14.85,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,I found it.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:14.85,0:17:17.35,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,How sad. It's trembling.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.35,0:17:21.06,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,I just boiled some water. Hold on a moment.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.60,0:17:24.86,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar e ciudat.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.69,0:17:29.36,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are almost no pets in the rear palace.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.86,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ai nevoie de un permis \Nca să deții un animal,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.86,0:17:34.57,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}iar pisicile și câinii trebuie castrați.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.87,0:17:37.66,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}De unde a apărut aceasta pisicuță?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.75,0:17:43.88,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,Wrap a bottle of hot water with cloth, \Nand put it next to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.88,0:17:45.84,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,You seem to be familiar with this.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:45.84,0:17:48.13,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,I found a cat before, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.13,0:17:50.09,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,It was a very cute calico.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.09,0:17:51.05,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.14,0:17:58.39,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,E foarte slabă. Avem \Ncumva niște lapte animal?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.39,0:18:00.89,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,Voi merge să întreb la bucătărie.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.89,0:18:02.52,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Și niște intestine.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.81,0:18:04.48,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,I-Intestine?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:04.48,0:18:07.32,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,I was thinking of using it as \Na replacement for its mother's teat.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:07.32,0:18:10.69,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,We had sausages a few times, \Nperhaps there's some in the kitchen...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.69,0:18:12.82,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,Bine, voi merge să întreb.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.53,0:18:19.12,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}It would have been best \Nto bathe it in warm water,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:19.12,0:18:21.75,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}dar în starea ei actuală, \Nnu v-a supraviețui.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:22.66,0:18:26.50,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Instead, I'll have to wipe off \Nthe dirt with a cloth,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.75,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}and kill any fleas with oil.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.38,0:18:34.22,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,Little lady, am găsit lapte de capră!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:34.55,0:18:35.93,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,Și niște intestine.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.93,0:18:37.55,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Mersi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.52,0:18:47.52,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,E așa de drăguță. \NE așa de drăguță!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.07,0:18:52.36,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}That night, the emperor \Nvisited the Jade Pavilion.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.86,0:18:56.07,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Am decis să păstrăm pisica.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.28,0:18:59.58,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Do continue to take care of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.16,0:19:02.91,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}The emperor can be a doting parent, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.91,0:19:07.42,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Maomao, taking care of a kitten. \NIt suits your name, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.80,0:19:13.38,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}When the kitten grew healthier,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.38,0:19:16.55,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,I washed it with a detergent \Nmade of crushed soap beans.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:16.55,0:19:18.76,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Uau, apa s-a făcut gri.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.30,0:19:22.97,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}I fed it milk for a while, \Nbut as it improved,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.97,0:19:25.77,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}it started to be able to eat shredded chicken.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:25.77,0:19:30.52,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,When we put down a box filled with \Nsand, it relieved itself on its own.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:34.65,0:19:37.41,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,We can't have you scratching the princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:37.41,0:19:39.16,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Cum merge creșterea copilului?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.03,0:19:44.25,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Cred că e pregătită să-i \Nfie arătată micuței prințese.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.25,0:19:45.37,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.50,0:19:50.79,Default,Guen,0,0,0,,Small fish? They might be a bit\N tough as-is. Shall I boil them?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.67,Default,Gaoshun,0,0,0,,O-Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.05,0:19:54.21,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,E femelă.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:54.21,0:19:57.18,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Da. Mă bucur că nu \Ntrebuie s-o castrăm—
Dialogue: 99,0:19:57.97,0:19:59.34,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Îmi cer scuze.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:59.34,0:20:02.01,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,E în regulă. \NNu-ți face griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.01,0:20:04.02,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Let me get you a snack as an apology...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.06,0:20:08.40,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can't put these out, I guess.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:11.69,0:20:13.19,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Vrei să încerci?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.19,0:20:15.49,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Nu-mi plac pisicile.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:15.49,0:20:16.86,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Deși te cheamă Maomao?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.86,0:20:18.28,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Mi se spune des.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.28,0:20:21.03,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Stăpâne Jinshi, văd că-ți plac pisicile.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.03,0:20:25.25,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Nu la fel de mult precum celor doi.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.75,0:20:28.25,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Nu prea înțeleg ce-i \Nfascinează așa de tare.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:28.25,0:20:32.00,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,De acord. Dar potrivit \Niubitorilor de pisici,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:32.00,0:20:35.46,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,faptul că nu înțelegi ce gândesc \Nface parte din farmecul lor.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.46,0:20:36.21,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.51,0:20:39.72,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,E distractiv să le privești. \NNu-ți poți lua ochii de la ele.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.72,0:20:41.97,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,After a while, you start \Nto want to touch them.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.97,0:20:42.72,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.18,0:20:45.18,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,They usually behave coldly,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.18,0:20:49.69,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,but suddenly become friendly \Nwhen you feed them, which is annoying.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.69,0:20:50.98,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Î-Înțeleg...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.44,0:20:55.28,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,At that point, they say \Nyou just kind of give up.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.57,0:21:01.91,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Poking at their paws, kissing them... \Nit all seems very unsanitary.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.87,0:21:10.08,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat, stăpâne Jinshi?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.71,0:21:15.80,Default,Jinshi,0,0,0,,Cred că încep să înțeleg și eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.09,0:21:20.26,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.84,0:21:24.85,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu au reușit să afle de \Nunde a venit pisicuță,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.85,0:21:29.35,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i1}deci au presupus că s-ar fi strecurat \Nînăuntru cu un cărucior de bagaje.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.06,0:21:31.85,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apoi, pisicuța...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.98,0:21:39.24,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,TLC,{\i1}a primit din partea împăratului \Ntitlul de „Admonisher of Thieves”.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.74,0:21:44.99,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i1}Altfel spus, a primit sarcina de a vâna \Nșobolanii care amenințau magazia clinicii.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.87,0:21:48.29,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.62,0:21:53.67,Default,Maomao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu voi înțelege niciodată de ce \Nau ales să-i pună numele Maomao.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:56.50,0:21:59.13,Default,Ailan,0,0,0,,Haide să terminăm \Nodată cu curățatul.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.13,0:22:01.88,Default,Yinghua,0,0,0,,Da. Vine caravana.
